# ---- Uploads ----
# REQUIRED in production. Must be a separate domain or CDN origin so that
# user-uploaded content cannot execute scripts under the app's origin (XSS).
# Example: https://uploads.aballeh.com  or  https://cdn.aballeh.com/uploads
# In local dev this can be omitted — the app falls back to /uploads (same origin)
# and logs a warning.
UPLOAD_BASE_URL=

# Optional: on-disk directory where uploads are stored.
# Defaults to <project-root>/public/uploads.
# UPLOAD_DIR=
